    {
      "id": "p0104-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As an example of the third function, \"Butterscotch Pie\" is normally abbreviated as the humorous \"ButtsPie\" in battle. But to avoid ruining the mood during serious scenes, Toby implemented the second set of \"serious\" abbreviations. Thus \"ButtsPie\" becomes \"Pie\" during important battles.",
        "raw": "As an example of the third function, \"Butterscotch Pie\" is normally abbreviated\nas the humorous \"ButtsPie\" in battle. But to avoid ruining the mood during\nserious scenes, Toby implemented the second set of \"serious\" abbreviations.\nThus \"ButtsPie\" becomes \"Pie\" during important battles.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29098512,
          0.42225714,
          0.9034705,
          0.48975
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28588566,
          0.42154286,
          0.90957965,
          0.49082143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "第三种用途的例子是“Butterscotch Pie”：通常战斗中会缩成滑稽的“ButtsPie”。但为了不破坏严肃场景的气氛，Toby 又做了第二套“严肃”缩写。因此在重要战斗中，“ButtsPie”就变成了“Pie”（派）。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
