    {
      "id": "p0104-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "With this in mind, Toby and the localization team decided to only use one set of full-length Japanese item names. This new approach meant that the original two-column item menu needed to be reprogrammed into a one-column item menu with a scrollbar. And because the player can switch between the English and Japanese versions of the game at any time, all of this new program code needed to safely coexist with the original game's code.",
        "raw": "With this in mind, Toby and the localization team decided to only use one set\nof full-length Japanese item names. This new approach meant that the original\ntwo-column item menu needed to be reprogrammed into a one-column item\nmenu with a scrollbar. And because the player can switch between the English\nand Japanese versions of the game at any time, all of this new program code\nneeded to safely coexist with the original game's code.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29337166,
          0.75317143,
          0.9043884,
          0.85751429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28588566,
          0.75245714,
          0.90957965,
          0.85858571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          41,
          42,
          43,
          44,
          45,
          46
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "考虑到这一点，Toby 和本地化团队决定，日文物品名称只保留一套全名。这就需要重新编程，把原来的双栏物品菜单改成带滚动条的单栏菜单。而玩家又可以随时切换游戏的英语版和日语版，所以所有新增代码都必须能与原版代码安全共存。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
